---
layout: base.njk
title: "DUE — Essays"
description: "See what is shipping now, browse recent essays, and jump into the next deadline."
---
{% set drafts = collections.draftEssays %}
{% set published = collections.publishedEssays %}
{% set latest = published | first %}

<section class="hero card spotlight">
  <div class="hero__copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Deadline for Unfinished Essays</p>
    <h2>Propose. Panic. Publish.</h2>
    <p class="lede">DUE is a collaborative platform for short-form essays written under pressure. Writers begin by proposing a topic, then have 30 days to complete an essay within a chosen word range—250–500, 500–1000, or 1000–1500 words. Once the deadline hits, the essay is published—finished or not.</p>
    <div class="legend-badges">
      <span class="legend-badge legend-badge--square magenta">Tiny · 250–500 words</span>
      <span class="legend-badge legend-badge--triangle orange">Minute · 500–1000 words</span>
      <span class="legend-badge legend-badge--circle teal">Short · 1000–1500 words</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__visual">
    <img class="hero__photo" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461344577544-4e5dc9487184?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80" alt="Pen furiously writing on a page">
    <div class="hero__stats">
      <div class="hero__stat">
        <span class="hero__stat-number">6</span>
        <span class="hero__stat-label">Essays published</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__stat">
        <span class="hero__stat-number">4</span>
        <span class="hero__stat-label">Ideas proposed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__stat">
        <span class="hero__stat-number">0</span>
        <span class="hero__stat-label">Days until next publication</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="grid grid-two">
  <article class="card in-progress">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Now writing</p>
      <h3>In progress</h3>
      <p>Deadlines arrive fast—track what is coming next. Drafts are view-only until they publish.</p>
    </div>
    {% if drafts.length %}
      {% set active = drafts[0] %}
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="meta">
          {% if active.data.word_range %}<span class="badge {{ active.data.word_range | wordRangeTone }}">{{ active.data.word_range }} words</span>{% endif %}
          {% if active.data.started_at %}<span>Started {{ active.data.started_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if active.data.deadline_at %}<span>Publishes {{ active.data.deadline_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <h4 class="card-title">{{ active.data.title }}</h4>
        {% if active.data.topic %}<p class="muted"><strong>Topic:</strong> {{ active.data.topic }}</p>{% endif %}
        <p class="countdown"><span data-countdown>{% if active.data.deadline_at %}Publishes at {{ active.data.deadline_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}{% else %}Deadline not yet scheduled.{% endif %}</span></p>
      </div>
      {% if drafts.length > 1 %}
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="stack">
          <p class="eyebrow">Also drafting</p>
          <ul class="draft-list">
            {% for draft in drafts %}
              {% if not loop.first %}
              <li>
                <span class="draft-title">{{ draft.data.title }}</span>
                {% if draft.data.deadline_at %}<span class="muted"> — publishes {{ draft.data.deadline_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
              </li>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <p>No drafts in progress. Check back soon for the next deadline.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </article>

  <article class="card">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Latest release</p>
      <h3>Most recently published</h3>
      <p>Catch up on what just shipped before the next round of edits.</p>
    </div>
    {% if latest %}
      {% set length = latest.data.word_range | wordRangeMeta %}
      <div class="stack">
        {% if latest.data.word_range %}
          <div class="length-chip" aria-label="Length: {{ latest.data.word_range }} words">
            <span class="length-icon length-icon--{{ length.icon }} length-icon--{{ length.palette }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="length-chip__text">
              <span>{{ latest.data.word_range }} words</span>
              {% if latest.data.word_count %}<span aria-hidden="true">•</span><span>{{ latest.data.word_count }} words</span>{% endif %}
            </span>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        <h4 class="card-title {{ length.titleClass }}"><a href="{{ latest.url | url }}">{{ latest.data.title }}</a></h4>
          {% set latestTimingLabel %}{% if latest.data.initial_status == 'complete' %}Finished on time{% else %}Unfinished on time{% endif %}{% endset %}
          {% set latestTimingClass %}{% if latest.data.initial_status == 'complete' %}badge--tone-success{% else %}badge--tone-warn{% endif %}{% endset %}
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="badge badge--tone-info">v{{ latest.data.version }}</span>
            <span class="badge {{ latestTimingClass }}">{{ latestTimingLabel }}</span>
            {% if latest.data.published_at %}<span>Published {{ latest.data.published_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
        <div class="meta">
          {% if latest.data.author %}<span>By <strong>@{{ latest.data.author }}</strong></span>{% endif %}
          {% if latest.data.topic %}<span>Topic: {{ latest.data.topic | shortWords(5) }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if latest.data.display_keywords and latest.data.display_keywords.length %}
            <span>Keywords: {{ latest.data.display_keywords | join(", ") }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if latest.data.release_notes and latest.data.release_notes.length %}
          <p class="muted"><strong>Latest:</strong> {{ latest.data.release_notes[0] }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p>No essays published yet.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </article>
</section>

<section class="card">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Explore</p>
    <h3>Keep reading and commenting</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Library</p>
      <h4 class="card-title">Browse all essays</h4>
      <p class="muted">See everything that has shipped and what is still cooking, all in one place.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href="{{ '/essays/' | url }}">Open the library →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Deadlines</p>
      <h4 class="card-title">Draft schedule</h4>
      <p class="muted">View every draft ordered by publish date so you can plan your reading. Drafts are read-only.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href="{{ '/drafts/' | url }}">See the queue (read-only) →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Backstory</p>
      <h4 class="card-title">About DUE</h4>
      <p class="muted">Learn how deadlines, acknowledgments, and the comment policy shape the project.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">Read the story →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
